
The Apocryphal Chronicles of the Rephaim & Moses


🏹 The Enochian Training at Mount Hermon & The Grand Canyon Pocket Dimension

According to ancient variants of the Enochian texts, during the descent of the Watchers, the Tribe of Rifiem (Rephaim) emerged as an elite warrior lineage tasked with teaching humanity martial arts, weapon forging, and self-defense strategies. During the Exodus, Moses led the Hebrews into deep desert pocket dimensions where the Rifiem trained them in advanced combat.
When the earth fractured during the rebellion of Korah (Numbers 16), a temporal rift opened. The remaining Rifiem lineages descended into the inner-earth chambers, establishing an offline pocket dimension beneath what is known today as the Grand Canyon (connected to early 20th-century archaeological discoveries of subterranean Egyptian-style vaults and giant mummified remains).
